      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Reasonable – a 1% fee is transparent. Sustainability depends on user acquisition and maintaining nonprofit partnerships.",
      "Differentiation": "• Weak – the core concept of a donation platform isn’t particularly unique. The privacy commitments are a positive differentiator, but not strong enough on its own.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Limited – relies on the nonprofits’ impact reporting.  Needs a more concrete plan for measuring and showcasing the platform’s overall impact (e.g., total donations facilitated, number of users engaged).",
      "Risk Awareness and Mitigation": "• Moderate – acknowledges technical and operational scaling challenges.  The experience with startup deployments is helpful, but lacks specifics on how those challenges will be addressed."
    },
    "Project B": {
      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Strong – clearly articulates the problem (wrist strain, inefficient navigation) and the solution (a wearable input ring). The gesture control concept is compelling.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Good – targets a specific niche (professionals, creatives, gamers) with a clear pain point.  The cross-platform compatibility expands potential reach.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Moderate – prototype complete, production underway, and compliance work initiated. The timeline is somewhat aggressive, but the early stage is promising.",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Moderate – the base product is sold, with an optional premium app for additional features.  Subscription revenue provides a potential revenue stream.",
      "Differentiation": "• Strong – the combination of full cursor control, gesture recognition, and a unique two-zone touch interface is distinct. The no-app design is also a plus.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Limited –  Needs user testing and feedback to demonstrate the ergonomic benefits and usability of the ring.  Quantifiable data on reduced wrist strain would be valuable.",
      "Risk Awareness and Mitigation": "• Moderate – acknowledges scaling challenges, Bluetooth performance, and QA.  Partnerships with experienced manufacturers are a positive indicator."
    }
  },
  "winner": "B"
}
